enter;\">50</td>\r\n<td class=\"text-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">500,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Request Money</td>\r\n<td class=\"text-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"2\">No Limit</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<br />\r\n<p>An upay account holder can keep a maximum amount of Tk 500,000 (including Cash Reward) in their upay account at any moment.<br /><br />*A maximum of &nbsp;Tk. 1,000 can be recharged to a prepaid mobile number and a maximum of Tk. 5,000 to a postpaid mobile number from a upay account in a single mobile recharge transaction.<br /><br />*For limited KYC customers, maximum Tk. 500 can recharged to a prepaid/postpaid mobile number at limited KYC status&nbsp;</p>\r\n<br /><br /><br /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>",
